# Licensed exercise clips must never enter this repo: it is public, and the
# ExerciseAnimatic N-EB2BL licence forbids distributing raw files. Media belongs
# in private hosting, fetched at runtime.
media-samples/
media/
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov

# Same reasoning for their data. catalogue.json carries the vendor's full
# step-by-step instructions for all 2,571 exercises, which is their dataset
# rather than ours to republish. Regenerate it from the bundle in one command:
#   py tools/extract-catalogue.py
# clips.json and coverage.md stay tracked — those are our ids and our report.
tools/catalogues/catalogue.json

